			x: 15.0d,
			y: 0.0d,
			title: "Found a guild",
			description: ["The guild is founded once a builder finishes a Guildhall for it: from then on every member works better. Get its blueprint at the Blueprint Table (pick it, press Get Blueprint: it takes a Blank Blueprint), right-click the ground where its front goes, stock the chests within 8 blocks of the table with what the blueprint lists when you hold Shift over it, and right-click your builder with it. A build shown greyed out at the Table isn't unlocked yet: the Table says how to get it."],
			dependencies: ["152E6CF8FF955275"],
			icon: {id: "minecraft:bell", count: 1},
