			title: "Proclaim an edict",
			description: ["Open the Book of Edicts on the hall's screen. An edict gives the village a boost and makes it pay for it: Long Shifts, Free Bread, Curfew... A Hamlet has room for one, a City for four. Pick one and proclaim it."],
