			description: ["A square stone-brick tower with a ladder up the middle and a lookout platform at the top; from tier II it houses a guard at its grindstone. Get its blueprint at the Blueprint Table (pick it, press Get Blueprint: it takes a Blank Blueprint), right-click the ground where its front goes, stock the chests within 8 blocks of the table with what the blueprint lists when you hold Shift over it, and right-click your builder with it. A build shown greyed out at the Table isn't unlocked yet: the Table says how to get it."],
